# ============================================
# 1. 忽略符号链接和构建产物（解决 fatal 错误）
# ============================================
UAV/simulation/air_ground_sim_ws/log/latest
UAV/simulation/air_ground_sim_ws/log/latest_build
UAV/simulation/air_ground_sim_ws/build/
UAV/simulation/air_ground_sim_ws/install/
UAV/simulation/air_ground_sim_ws/log/

# ============================================
# 2. 忽略嵌套的 Git 仓库（解决 embedded repo 警告）
# ============================================
UAV/air_ground_open_source/01_flight_stack/ardupilot/
UAV/air_ground_open_source/06_simulation/ardupilot_gazebo/

# 第三方开源参考集合整体仅本地保留（约 2GB：SITL_Models/nav2/ardupilot 等），
# 仓库只跟踪其中精选的 src/（vendored ros_gz）
UAV/air_ground_open_source/*
!UAV/air_ground_open_source/src/

# ============================================
# 3. 忽略临时文件和日志
# ============================================
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ============================================
# 4. 忽略 ROS/Colcon 构建产物
# ============================================
build/
install/
log/
devel/
.catkin_workspace
.colcon/

# ============================================
# 5. 忽略其他大文件/二进制
# ============================================
*.pdf
*.pgm
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg